      "writtenOn": "2025-03-20T16:54:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi, This patch broke AOSP on SM8550 (Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Gen 2) HDK devboard . It runs into a kernel panic when it starts first stage init. I see:\n\n```\n[    2.711239][    T1] Run /init as init process\n[    2.716083][    T1] Kernel panic - not syncing: Attempted to kill init! exitcode\u003d0x00000004\n[    2.724655][    T1] CPU: 7 UID: 0 PID: 1 Comm: init Tainted: G S                 6.12.5-android16-0-gc82917ebd289-ab12815448-4k #1 9cda869e7cfa070235f3fafafc77603049acbc05\n[    2.740355][    T1] Tainted: [S]\u003dCPU_OUT_OF_SPEC\n[    2.745101][    T1] Hardware name: Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. SM8550 HDK (DT)\n[    2.752522][    T1] Call trace:\n[    2.755757][    T1]  dump_backtrace+0xec/0x128\n[    2.760335][    T1]  show_stack+0x18/0x28\n[    2.764460][    T1]  dump_stack_lvl+0x40/0x88\n[    2.768945][    T1]  dump_stack+0x18/0x24\n[    2.773069][    T1]  panic+0x134/0x354\n[    2.776928][    T1]  do_exit+0x820/0x99c\n[    2.780969][    T1]  do_group_exit+0x70/0x9c\n[    2.785365][    T1]  get_signal+0x768/0x870\n[    2.789675][    T1]  do_signal+0xdc/0x2224\n[    2.793885][    T1]  do_notify_resume+0x64/0x120\n[    2.798632][    T1]  el0_sve_acc+0x70/0x74\n[    2.802844][    T1]  el0t_64_sync_handler+0xa8/0xbc\n[    2.807862][    T1]  el0t_64_sync+0x1a8/0x1ac\n[    2.812344][    T1] SMP: stopping secondary CPUs\n[    2.817803][    T1] Kernel Offset: 0x21bc280000 from 0xffffffc080000000\n[    2.824601][    T1] PHYS_OFFSET: 0x80000000\n[    2.828909][    T1] CPU features: 0x30,009c0007,00226128,564676af\n[    2.835171][    T1] Memory Limit: none\n```\n\nIf I revert this patch then I can boot past this crash.\n\nCan you please check if this device\u0027s target arch/cpu config https://cs.android.com/android//platform/superproject/main/+/main:device/linaro/dragonboard/sm8x50/BoardConfig.mk;l\u003d3 need to be updated accordingly. I thought `kryo385` cpu variant may be an issue but changing it to cortex-a55 didn\u0027t help either.",
      "revId": "7066039f37182e89820b8c0f4b075a2941336d15",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "16d983a2_ed3bc743",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 11
